{#
  The submitter's receipt for a form response.

  `answers_summary` and `payment_summary` arrive as PLAIN TEXT, one item
  per line, and are rendered here with `|nl2br`: they are declared
  variables (module.json), so a unit that reworded this e-mail still gets
  the recap and the payment details substituted into its own text. A loop
  over a list would not survive that — a customised body substitutes
  strings and has no notion of a list.

  The SEPA QR code is the one thing a customised body cannot carry (it is
  an image, and the editor stores none), so it is shipped-only and written
  `|default('')`. Everything needed to pay — amount, IBAN, structured
  communication — is in `payment_summary` and therefore survives. The
  ticket's own QR is shipped-only for the same reason, and its reference
  is a declared variable for the opposite one: most mail clients block
  images by default, and a buyer whose ticket did not render must not be
  left with nothing to show at the door.

  TWO CODES, AND THE TICKET COMES FIRST — it is the one needed first in
  time. Each carries its own heading, but the readability of this e-mail
  is not what makes it safe: the door's scanner accepts an EPC transfer
  payload as readily as a bare reference, and answers with the right
  ticket either way, so handing over the wrong code costs nothing.
#}
{% extends 'email/base.html.twig' %}
{% block content %}
    <h2 style="margin:0 0 20px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;color:#212529;">Nous avons bien reçu votre réponse</h2>
    <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Bonjour,</p>
    <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
        Votre réponse pour <strong>{{ article_title }}</strong> est bien enregistrée.
    </p>
    {% if event_summary|default('') %}
        <p style="margin:0 0 16px;padding:12px 16px;background-color:#f8f9fa;border-radius:6px;">{{ event_summary|nl2br }}</p>
    {% endif %}
    {% if answers_summary %}
        <p style="margin:0 0 8px;">Voici ce que nous avons noté :</p>
        <p style="margin:0 0 16px;padding:12px 16px;background-color:#f8f9fa;border-radius:6px;">{{ answers_summary|nl2br }}</p>
    {% endif %}
    {% if ticket_reference|default('') %}
        <div style="margin:0 0 16px;padding:16px;border:2px dashed #adb5bd;border-radius:8px;text-align:center;">
            <p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;color:#6c757d;">
                Votre billet — le code à présenter à l'entrée
            </p>
            {% if ticket_qr|default('') %}
                <p style="margin:0 0 12px;">
                    <img src="{{ ticket_qr }}" alt="QR code du billet" width="180" height="180">
                </p>
            {% endif %}
            <p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-family:monospace;font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.15em;color:#212529;">{{ ticket_reference }}</p>
            <p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#6c757d;">
                Présentez ce code à l'entrée. Si l'image ne s'affiche pas, la référence ci-dessus
                suffit — nous pouvons la saisir à la main.
            </p>
        </div>
    {% endif %}
    {% if payment_summary %}
        <p style="margin:0 0 8px;"><strong>Paiement</strong></p>
        <p style="margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 16px;background-color:#f8f9fa;border-radius:6px;">{{ payment_summary|nl2br }}</p>
        {% if payment_qr|default('') %}
            <p style="margin:0 0 8px;text-align:center;">
                <img src="{{ payment_qr }}" alt="QR code de paiement SEPA" width="180" height="180">
            </p>
            <p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:13px;color:#6c757d;text-align:center;">
                Scannez ce QR code avec votre application bancaire pour payer.
            </p>
        {% endif %}
    {% endif %}
    {% if edit_url %}
        <p style="margin:24px 0;text-align:center;">
            <a href="{{ edit_url }}"
               style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 28px;background-color:#0d6efd;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;font-weight:bold;">
                Modifier mes réponses
            </a>
        </p>
    {% endif %}
    <p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#6c757d;">
        Vous recevez ce message parce que cette adresse a été utilisée pour répondre à ce formulaire.
    </p>
{% endblock %}
